Depends: R (>= 3.5)
Imports:
  ggplot2
Description: This package provides themes for ggplot2 based
  on the graphical style from the Utrecht University (the Netherlands).
  It includes fuctions to create publication-ready figures with the
  official fonts and colours from the UU.
